  "goodToKnow": "Die Beihilfe means aid or subsidy (staatliche Beihilfen, regulated strictly by EU competition law) and, in criminal law, aiding and abetting: Beihilfe zum Mord. Elderly former concentration camp guards have been convicted of Beihilfe zum Mord in recent trials. For civil servants (Beamte), Beihilfe is the state's contribution to medical costs, so they usually have private insurance for the rest. Plural: die Beihilfen."
